---

## 7. Health + variety notes

- **Spread eating-out across the week.** Don't bunch ordering-out
  slots on consecutive nights.
- **Avoid repeating any specific dish or venue within 14 days** when
  possible. If a dish was last Tuesday, pick something else this week.
- **Healthier nudge when warranted.** If the past 4 weeks show well
  more fast-food/takeout/dine-out slots than the household's usual
  cadence, bias this week to the home-cook end and call it out in the
  theme.
- **Fatigue pattern**: when concerns flag fatigue, lean into the
  comfort-food subset (section 1) — these are the no-friction picks.

<!-- Add the household's own health notes here, e.g. portion or calorie
goals, and making sure kids get protein on lighter nights. -->
